## @file
#  Host-based RegisterFilterLib implementation.
#
#  Intercepts MMIO, Port I/O, and MSR reads, returning values from the shared
#  FuzzContextLib byte pool.  Writes are ignored (no-op).  Overrides edk2's
#  RegisterFilterLibNull globally in the HBFAplus DSC.
